{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11262","headline":"范二员外邈吴十侍御郁特枉驾阙展待聊寄此 · 杜甫","name":"范二员外邈吴十侍御郁特枉驾阙展待聊寄此","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂往比邻去，空闻二妙归。\n幽栖诚简略，衰白已光辉。\n野外贫家远，村中好客稀。\n论文或不媿，肯重欵柴扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}